aracter flaw of our hero, where they still need to grow\u201d and \u201cthis is a character trait of our hero, which makes them awesome.\u201d Bond in particular is a womanizer who uses, then discards women and that is very much a part of the Power fantasy he invokes.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've only watched one Bond movie, the most recent one, but in believe you then, so you do got a point,althought inshould point out Bond is am very old character so his sexism shouldn't feel out of place","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-26T13:20:08-07:00","id":1343847,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1343698-do-you-believe-that-depiction-equals-endorsement?p=1343843#post1343843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I've only watched one Bond movie, the most recent one, but in believe you then, so you do got a point,althought inshould point out Bond is am very old character so his sexism shouldn't feel out of place</div> </div> </div> </div>Just because it was commonplace and not widely criticized at the time doesn\u2019t mean it is above criticism now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited